4-4e85-9c21-3daa0ef9848b" facs="#m-5d0cb7af-7c53-4752-bf58-4f1681e05276" label="ambiguous">sime</l><l xml:id="m-816a8436-6e09-4cc4-9136-1100948b143e" facs="#m-1547ab13-61de-41bb-af14-90ea188703b4" label="ambiguous">Secret</l><l xml:id="m-23262878-cfda-4f33-80d7-7ee8e0d5e7dd" facs="#m-542152de-111b-4d4e-96f0-19151cfc062c" label="lyrics-like">"ccipe, quaésumus, Dómine, mú¬ suffragántibus méritis, ad nostrae</l><l xml:id="m-9582459d-b243-46a6-99e1-d94bb1c4a88f" facs="#m-54e70be5-83af-4643-bf4c-a570650ac75d" label="lyrics-like">Il nera laetántis Ecclésiae, et, salútis auxslium provenire concéde.</l><l xml:id="m-a09e1128-2a27-4b0d-9d52-88e865a8bea1" facs="#m-73d0a639-23a2-44b8-8899-dbe504a70ee1" label="lyrics-like">beâtae Virginis Mariae Reginael Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d72af20b-d956-4d40-a496-2ffcc7f3dbe2" facs="#m-4a077823-315c-426a-ba8a-5819a45e3e5c" label="lyrics-like">Preface of the B. V. M. Et te in Festivitáte. p. 10.</l><l xml:id="m-4f099599-1855-48c0-a647-82f0e849a459" facs="#m-98dac28e-abed-4446-970c-34b927d52449" label="lyrics-like">Communton. Regina múndi. p. 1558.</l><l xml:id="m-98d31f33-c927-4411-8ac3-309a2fbf479e" facs="#m-3a0a3124-a8e2-4d57-9777-8fc11c3bddcc" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-fb52e98c-f91c-4fd0-898c-ee3bf69c8f81" facs="#m-6dc0de1b-0ed8-4ccc-8439-9366f911e57e" label="lyrics-like">velebrátis solémniis, Dómine,[ cessióne fiant salutária; in cuius</l><l xml:id="m-752e0c85-600b-4633-b69d-63084230a421" facs="#m-2e90a5da-dcf7-49ce-8d68-2e1f3d994cb1" label="lyrics-like">Lquae pro sanctae Mariae, Re-l honôre sunt exsultánter impléta.</l><l xml:id="m-4bf12ae2-0c19-446f-95b7-7615b0215c4a" facs="#m-a8e70d68-cad2-43dd-94e1-9c0b48198946" label="lyrics-like">ginae nostrae, festivitáte perégi¬</l><l xml:id="m-ebab433b-5c22-48d5-9e70-32ec6f68e050" facs="#m-ddf71d06-fba6-42dc-ab4d-c0052968c3fc" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum nostrum Jesum Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-02a18af4-e332-44b5-bf5f-47941cfa4f0b" facs="#m-cd73123e-c940-459c-9848-4a263e3d6fca" label="lyrics-like">mus: ejus, quaésumus, nobis inter-l stum.</l><l xml:id="m-d97416a5-b333-4303-951b-c8bcabe3cf16" facs="#m-32f90edf-cd68-4773-bbaf-6301ee718a48" label="text-like">AT SEXT</l><l xml:id="m-71c19c61-fe1c-42ac-ac9b-77182baf21f5" facs="#m-7996dda2-e34b-4432-bb7f-7e8d5792f793" label="ambiguous">Chapter</l><l xml:id="m-5de9a7d4-7dd2-4cbd-8448-053cf189770f" facs="#m-d0404614-77e5-4ffd-9dd6-3ff1677e299e" label="ambiguous">Eccli. 24. 9-11</l><l xml:id="m-dd54610d-e7c9-423e-b411-a61823f413a5" facs="#m-a44eb916-86b1-482e-9e22-d0f87437b618" label="lyrics-like">'n omni terra steti et in omni pó-] léntium et humslium corda virtúte</l><l xml:id="m-448ae0a4-5e02-4dc4-88d6-dbd7be55195b" facs="#m-619de72f-6774-4712-8438-bc5462158da2" label="lyrics-like">L pulo, t et in omni gente pri-[caleávi.</l><l xml:id="m-7529e62c-1ee1-4d98-a18e-16586ccdc4d7" facs="#m-20f4b4f6-a3a2-4905-8dfd-023195766cbc" label="lyrics-like">matum hábui, *et ómnium excel¬</l><l xml:id="m-8c3c5f08-bfb1-4035-a826-9f99ade08faa" facs="#m-9a77726a-e274-40d2-b6c9-a3f0b11d3004" label="text-like">Out of Paschal Time</l><l xml:id="m-e07774c7-a906-45e1-be90-4e49038d25fe" facs="#m-6ae7108a-e504-4e0d-bb4a-20b501c5f877" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-7e4898bd-b25c-4a7b-bc44-168b7134b7c9" facs="#m-04bbfe3b-e416-487c-b6da-05c787ba865e" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-d2fda746-43a8-4bbd-9f03-8cfae1a43a6c" facs="#m-a8f3a1e6-da5c-4e77-bd25-11a64d1d92c1" label="lyrics-like">tábat júxta crúcem Jé-su “Má-ter é-jus. V. In pas¬</l><l xml:id="m-bdc5a54f-8b95-4d88-83d0-73c6aade0d27" facs="#m-968e013b-b2da-43f8-a8d8-3a298aa21ee4" label="ambiguous">D</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
